  "source_strategy": "The brief supplies all UI content, tokens and procedural geometry. No external webpage source or capture is needed. All visuals are DOM, CSS and SVG.",
  "shot_brief": "A stationary Baste fitting table shows a left editorial lockup, central woven cloth with a pinned app garment, and right chalk token notes. The same app's obsession, spaces, music, chips, font, colors, radii and density change from cyberbotanist to nightmarketcoder to liminalweeb. Each change cuts the previous garment along a drawn diagonal red basting thread and reveals the next fitting. Cloth re-dyes, notes gently rise and fade, pins rock only subtly, and the final cyber fitting returns to exactly the starting state for a seamless loop.",
  "customize": {
    "catalog_policy": "Builder performs live registry searches before hand-authoring named looks. Reuse only where the exact specified design is preserved; diagonal cut binding and bespoke procedural UI may be authored as gaps. Do not select a catalog aesthetic that changes this brief.",
    "runtime": "GSAP paused timeline registered on window.__timelines; deterministic at arbitrary seek times; palette through CSS custom properties"
  },
